    {
      "start": "01:16:43,421",
      "end": "01:16:45,189",
      "text": "Yeah, okay, we're all good now."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:16:45,223",
      "end": "01:16:47,425",
      "text": "Wow, my dad's gonna flip when he finds out about us."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:16:47,458",
      "end": "01:16:49,661",
      "text": "- Well, we're safe for now, but listen, let's... - Safe?"
