      "text": "None of us are safe."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:16:52,664",
      "end": "01:16:55,433",
      "text": "Mr. Moon, I know someone who can protect us."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:16:55,466",
      "end": "01:16:58,770",
      "text": "Right. Mm-hmm. Yeah. Yeah."
    },
    {
