      "text": "Spoiled little brat."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:17:42,013",
      "end": "01:17:44,549",
      "text": "All right, time to get us an audience."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:17:44,582",
      "end": "01:17:47,719",
      "text": "Wait. Moon, as soon as you start inviting folks in here,"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:17:47,752",
      "end": "01:17:50,388",
      "text": "hotel security will just shut us down, right?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:17:50,421",
      "end": "01:17:52,790",
      "text": "Oh, it's okay. Rosita's got that covered."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:17:54,959",
      "end": "01:17:57,261",
      "text": "Norman, release the piglets."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:18:00,898",
      "end": "01:18:02,767",
      "text": "♪ No, not today... ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:18:08,005",
      "end": "01:18:10,441",
      "text": "Hey, no!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:18:13,311",
      "end": "01:18:17,615",
      "text": "All security, we have a situation on floor 17."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:18:17,648",
      "end": "01:18:20,752",
      "text": "Repeat, all security to floor 17."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:18:20,785",
      "end": "01:18:24,555",
      "text": "This is the best day of my life, Daddy! Whoo!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:18:24,589",
      "end": "01:18:28,493",
      "text": "Repeat, everybody to floor 17!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:18:29,627",
      "end": "01:18:32,029",
      "text": "Wait, uh, is it on?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:18:32,064",
      "end": "01:18:33,931",
      "text": "- Yes, it's on now. - Oh, now?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:18:33,965",
      "end": "01:18:35,633",
      "text": "- Yes, now. - Oh, yes, yes, yes, yes."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:18:35,666",
      "end": "01:18:37,301",
      "text": "Before I blah, blah, blah, blah, blah. Yeah, yeah, okay."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:18:37,335",
      "end": "01:18:38,870",
      "text": "Good evening."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:18:38,903",
      "end": "01:18:40,705",
      "text": "Uh, my name is Buster Moon,"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:18:40,738",
      "end": "01:18:42,907",
      "text": "and it is my great pleasure to present to you,"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:18:42,940",
      "end": "01:18:45,376",
      "text": "for one night only in the Crystal Tower Theater..."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:18:45,409",
      "end": "01:18:46,878",
      "text": "Mr. Crystal's office."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:18:46,911",
      "end": "01:18:48,379",
      "text": "This is Jerry speaking."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:18:48,412",
      "end": "01:18:52,383",
      "text": "...a brand-new show called Out of This World."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:18:52,416",
      "end": "01:18:55,620",
      "text": "A musical space odyssey featuring the return of"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:18:55,653",
      "end": "01:18:57,789",
      "text": "the legendary Clay Calloway."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:18:57,822",
      "end": "01:19:01,059",
      "text": "That's right, Clay Calloway."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:01,093",
      "end": "01:19:04,462",
      "text": "And what's more, this show is completely free,"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:04,495",
      "end": "01:19:07,465",
      "text": "so step right up, folks, and take your seats."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:07,498",
      "end": "01:19:10,568",
      "text": "The journey of a lifetime is about to begin."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:10,601",
      "end": "01:19:13,671",
      "text": "All right, folks, we all set back here?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:13,704",
      "end": "01:19:15,406",
      "text": "There he is!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:15,439",
      "end": "01:19:17,041",
      "text": "Dad."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:17,075",
      "end": "01:19:18,810",
      "text": "- Come here. - What are you wearing?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:18,843",
      "end": "01:19:20,478",
      "text": "Oh, well, we're still doing"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:20,511",
      "end": "01:19:22,346",
      "text": "our community service, ain't we, lads?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:22,380",
      "end": "01:19:23,548",
      "text": "- Yeah. - That's right."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:23,581",
      "end": "01:19:25,917",
      "text": "Oh, my gosh. He's here."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:25,950",
      "end": "01:19:26,951",
      "text": "Crystal's here?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:26,984",
      "end": "01:19:29,987",
      "text": "No. M-My ice cream guy."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:30,021",
      "end": "01:19:32,090",
      "text": "And he's sitting in the front row."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:32,124",
      "end": "01:19:34,559",
      "text": "- Mr. Crystal! Mr. Crystal! - Aah! Jerry!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:34,592",
      "end": "01:19:36,128",
      "text": "- Mr. Crystal, wake up, wake up. - I tried to stop him, sir."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:36,161",
      "end": "01:19:37,595",
      "text": "I-I'm so sorry. I'm so sorry to wake you up, sir."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:37,628",
      "end": "01:19:38,963",
      "text": "It's Moon. He's taken over the theater,"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:38,996",
      "end": "01:19:40,598",
      "text": "and he's putting on a show right now."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:40,631",
      "end": "01:19:42,867",
      "text": "He's what?!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:52,110",
      "end": "01:19:53,611",
      "text": "Okay, this is it, guys. You ready?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:53,644",
      "end": "01:19:55,446",
      "text": "Oh, my gosh. Are we really doing this?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:55,479",
      "end": "01:19:56,848",
      "text": "Yeah, you better believe it."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:56,881",
      "end": "01:19:59,617",
      "text": "Yeah, big-time, baby!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:19:59,650",
      "end": "01:20:00,718",
      "text": "Remember..."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:20:00,751",
      "end": "01:20:04,522",
      "text": "There's only one way left to go, and that's up!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:20:04,555",
      "end": "01:20:06,023",
      "text": "- Yeah! - Let's do it! Come on!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:20:06,058",
      "end": "01:20:08,893",
      "text": "Gunter robot activating piggy power."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:20:08,926",
      "end": "01:20:10,095",
      "text": "Beep-beep, boop-boop."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:20:10,128",
      "end": "01:20:11,662",
      "text": "Playback!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:20:16,467",
      "end": "01:20:20,972",
      "text": "All creatures great and small,"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:20:21,005",
      "end": "01:20:23,908",
      "text": "welcome to outer space."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:20:33,885",
      "end": "01:20:36,721",
      "text": "My name is Captain Rosita."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:20:36,754",
      "end": "01:20:40,591",
      "text": "My mission: to find and rescue a space explorer"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:20:40,625",
      "end": "01:20:43,661",
      "text": "who mysteriously went missing long ago."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:20:43,694",
      "end": "01:20:47,431",
      "text": "Captain, I am picking up his signal."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:20:47,465",
      "end": "01:20:49,901",
      "text": "Excellent. But from which planet?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:20:49,934",
      "end": "01:20:51,502",
      "text": "I see four of them ahead."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:20:51,535",
      "end": "01:20:53,771",
      "text": "It is impossible to know which one"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:20:53,804",
      "end": "01:20:55,840",
      "text": "the signal is, like, coming from."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:20:55,873",
      "end": "01:20:57,142",
      "text": "I see."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:20:57,175",
      "end": "01:20:59,177",
      "text": "Then I'll have to explore them all."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:20:59,211",
      "end": "01:21:01,113",
      "text": "Take us down."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:21:01,146",
      "end": "01:21:02,880",
      "text": "You've got this, big guy."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:21:02,914",
      "end": "01:21:05,583",
      "text": "Remember what I said... just go with the flow."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:21:06,984",
      "end": "01:21:09,820",
      "text": "Mission report. I must take care,"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:21:09,854",
      "end": "01:21:13,591",
      "text": "for I have landed on the Planet of War."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:21:22,200",
      "end": "01:21:24,202",
      "text": "♪ 'Cause you're a sky ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:21:24,236",
      "end": "01:21:28,673",
      "text": "♪ 'Cause you're a sky full of stars ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:21:30,108",
