      "text": "♪ 'Cause in a sky ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:23:04,702",
      "end": "01:23:08,173",
      "text": "♪ 'Cause in a sky full of stars ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:23:08,206",
      "end": "01:23:13,078",
      "text": "♪ I think I saw you ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:23:35,699",
